      "notes": "PIN_NEOPIXEL — onboard WS2812 addressable RGB LED, output-only. Confirmed via probonopd's YD-RP2040 gist, vcc-gnd-yd-rp2040 Rust HAL docs, and MicroPython PR #12281 pins.csv/board.py (neopixel,GPIO23 / Pin.OUT). Some board revisions need the R68 solder-jumper bridged for the LED to actually respond.\nCheck if available on board"
