        "digital_output",
        "pwm_output",
        "button"
      ],
      "notes": "PIN_USRKEY — onboard user pushbutton, active-low, requires the MCU's internal pull-up (board has no external pull-up on this line). Confirmed via probonopd's gist, MicroPython PR #12281 board.py (Pin.IN, Pin.PULL_UP), and en.neonhero.dev (GPIO_IRQ_EDGE_FALL + explicit no-external-pull-up caveat).\nCheck if available on board"
